# WS2d half 1: the stored census and the peak move TOGETHER — when a deeper red
# resets the peak, the census behind it is re-captured. Freeze the assignment
# (keep the old value) and `censusAtPeak` describes an earlier, milder moment
# than the peak it is supposed to explain; the deeper-red assertion catches it.
file: rust/banshee-core/src/pressure/episode.rs
test: the_peak_census_tracks_the_worst_moment
---OLD---
    next.census_at_peak = census.map(summarise);
---NEW---
    next.census_at_peak = next.census_at_peak.clone();
